      "en": "An **allowlist** = the tools allowed for each task (an «ask about an order» task has no refund tool at all). Tools that act on money or data go to an **approval queue** for **human approval** — an n8n Wait node or a Telegram button (week 36). The agent gets a «waiting for approval» reply and carries on."
